{"id":"derecha","lemma":"derecha","pos":"noun","rank":666,"glosses":["right (direction)","right (ensemble of right-wing political parties; political conservatives as a group)"],"ipa":"/deˈɾet͡ʃa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"derechas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-derecha.wav","examples":[{"text":"Gira a la derecha.","en":"Turn right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438265"},{"text":"Las paredes en la vieja casa no estaban derechas.","en":"The walls in the old house were not straight."},{"text":"Giré a la derecha.","en":"I turned right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50371"},{"text":"Quédate a la derecha.","en":"Keep to the right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721427"},{"text":"Girad a la derecha.","en":"Turn to the right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/43036"}]}